Switched launchd from detached main deployment 73c6449 to feature checkout commit 904a61b. Verified private backups of plist/env/YAML/overrides and 135 OAuth files; imported signing key/state and effective config for verified owner; granted four current Claude clients. All 8 upstreams initialized; prior tools retained plus range_cached_output. Public and loopback health/discovery/identity passed; same pre-switch Auth0-backed probe credential survived migration and a second restart. Static bearer correctly rejected. Codex config was not edited: user must remove static header, OAuth login, obtain explicit coding-agent client grant, and reconnect. Production refresh exchange remains unverified because existing sessions lack refresh tokens. Details in acceptance deployment section; private rollback material in ~/.local/state/easy-mcp-proxy-migration-20261015.
